variant.changelog:
- Added options "Auto-open Aethernet Badge when coming close to aetheryte" and "Auto-open Instance Badge when coming close to aetheryte";
- Clicking overlay badge will now close opened badge even in hover mode;
- Added an option "Minimum Popout Width";
- Added few one-click badge overlay sizing presets into configuration;
- Old overlay system reactivated in a partial way. It is available only for normal aethernet and instances; it will not be available for worlds. Disabled by default - activate in `/lifestream` - Legacy overlay.

